Package: mrioTensor
Type: Package
Title: Tensor-Aware Multi-Regional Input-Output Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Zhen", family = "Ma",
    email = "mzhen5082@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Lightweight tools for reshaping multi-regional input-output
    (MRIO) matrices into semantically structured fourth-order tensors
    (origin region, origin sector, destination region, destination sector).
    Implements exact multi-mode array transformations, mode-n contractions,
    standard Leontief output solves, and embodied environmental intensity
    accounting, alongside truncated Higher-Order SVD (HOSVD) decomposition.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/MaEconStat/mrioTensor
BugReports: https://github.com/MaEconStat/mrioTensor/issues
